{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42219","headline":"送杨郎中唐员外奉使湖南 · 徐铉","name":"送杨郎中唐员外奉使湖南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江边微雨柳条新，握节含香二使臣。\n两绶对悬云梦日，方舟齐泛洞庭春。\n今朝草木逢新律，昨日山川满战尘。\n同是多情怀古客，不妨爲赋吊灵均。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42219.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42219","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}